      "image": "assets/images/265369/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil; add pasta and boil until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/REPrLmfqvZwURgLuOSpYCjSwBU0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/265369-dill-pickle-pasta-salad-VAT-001-step-02-5557a2ff35574eecbd9d6a6b383ac616.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/265369/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the pasta is cooking, mix mayonnaise, pickles, mustard, vinegar, sugar, salt, pepper, celery salt, and garlic powder together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XqcRwXAPuv_CVieK3LtI9V4PXbY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/265369-dill-pickle-pasta-salad-VAT-001-step-03-c2b077a21c7f48b886e1f1cd8fcf2277.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/265369/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain pasta, then rinse under cold water until cold. Transfer to a large salad bowl; stir in dressing and toss to coat. Add additional pickle chunks to taste.",
